</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">202</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">年1月</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">21</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">日</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>注意事项</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1.一切活动均要以安全为首要前提。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2.“班内统筹安排”意为：班内安排一个小队/个人完成该主题的</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">任意一种形式</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的活动即可。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3.本次</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">寒假</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">不统一发放社会实践活动记录表，如有需要的，可以下载电子版自行打印</span></p><p style="line-height: 16px;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/1/202501211315124581.gif" /><a style="font-size:12px; color:#0066cc;" href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/1/202501211314574799.doc" title="202501211314574799.doc">202501211314574799.doc</a></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">【以文章、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绘画、书法、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">视频等</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">作品形式</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">呈现的活动，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">无须填表</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，开学后直接凭作品认定学时学分；纯粹外出活动</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">只有照片没有作品</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的，则</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">需要填表</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，每个活动每个参与者填写一张，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">严格按表内要求填写、敲章</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，开学后凭表认定学时学分。】</span>
</p>
    
